From 61c8cad66b7d4818956e4ff62ccf142fde51ca11 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 21 Jun 2026 15:05:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] fix(dashboard+profile): fix tabs, ratings reply, wallet
 balance

- Change <script> to <script is:inline> so switchTab/sendReply onclick
  handlers are accessible from HTML attributes in Astro
- Add loadRatingStat() called at startup to show numeric rating in stat card
- Add sendReply() for drivers to reply to customer ratings
- Add rating reply CSS and update ratings query to include id/driver_reply
- Use add_wallet_balance RPC instead of upsert to accumulate wallet balance
- Profile: replace stat-spent with stat-wallet card linking to /wallet page
- Profile: add fetchWallet() and render balance in stat-wallet element

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
